
/* website-words-5 extras */
.ba{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:22px 30px}
.ba .lb{font:800 17px Inter;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:8px;flex:none}
.ba.old{background:#faf9fb;border-bottom:1px solid #efedf3}
.ba.old .lb{background:#fde8e8;color:#c0392b}
.ba.new .lb{background:#e5f6ec;color:#1f7a4a}
.ba .tx{font:700 30px/1.25 'DM Sans';letter-spacing:-.01em}
.ba.old .tx{color:#9a97a3;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:#d93a3a;text-decoration-thickness:3px}
.site{border-top:1px solid #efedf3}
.site .nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 26px;font:800 23px 'DM Sans';color:#2d4a3e}
.site .nav i{font:500 15px Inter;font-style:normal;color:#8a8794}
.site .hero{position:relative;height:250px;background-size:cover;background-position:center}
.site .hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(20,40,32,.82),rgba(20,40,32,.15))}
.site .hero div{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:26px;color:#fff}
.btn2{display:inline-block;background:#f2b544;color:#2d2410;font:700 19px Inter;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:10px}
.btnx{display:inline-block;background:#e9e7ee;color:#77737f;font:600 19px Inter;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:6px}
</style></head><body>

<!-- 1 cover -->
<div class="s" id="s1">
 <div class="ph" style="height:1350px"><img src="img/groom.jpg" style="object-position:55% 35%"></div>
 <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(21,12,43,.05) 0%,rgba(21,12,43,.35) 30%,rgba(21,12,43,.97) 58%)"></div>
 <div class="card" style="left:300px;right:70px;top:100px;transform:rotate(3deg);box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.5)">
  <div class="bar"><span class="d"></span><span class="url"><b>fernbrookgrooming</b>.com.au</span></div>
  <div style="padding:26px 30px 30px;text-align:center">
   <div style="font:700 36px Georgia;color:#6b6774"><span class="mk" data-c="1">Welcome to our website!</span></div>
   <div style="font-size:20px;color:#a5a1ad;margin-top:14px">We offer a wide range of solutions.</div>
   <div class="btnx" style="margin-top:18px">Click here</div></div>
 </div>
 <div class="note" style="left:100px;top:420px;transform:rotate(-6deg);font-size:38px">sound<br>familiar?</div>
 <div class="h" style="top:640px;font-size:100px;z-index:6">Swap these 5 phrases <em>on your website</em></div>
 <div class="sub" style="top:1100px;font-size:36px;color:#E4DEFF;z-index:6">Customers skim right past them. Swipe &#8594;</div>
 <div class="ft" style="z-index:6"><span>@nexaweb_dev</span><span class="dots" data-on="1"></span></div>
</div>

<!-- 2 welcome -->
<div class="s" id="s2">
 <div class="ph"><img src="img/fluffy.jpg" style="object-position:50% 30%"></div><div class="num">01</div>
 <div class="h">"Welcome to our <em>website"</em></div>
 <div class="sub">They know. They're already on it.</div>
 <div class="card" style="top:610px;transform:rotate(-1deg)">
  <div class="ba old"><span class="lb">BEFORE</span><span class="tx">Welcome to our website!</span></div>
  <div class="site"><div class="nav">Fernbrook Grooming<i>Services &nbsp;Prices &nbsp;Book</i></div>
   <div class="hero" style="background-image:url(img/groom.jpg);background-position:50% 30%">
    <div style="top:34px;font:800 36px/1.1 'DM Sans';width:430px"><span class="mk">Dog grooming in Ryde.</span></div>
    <div style="top:120px;font:500 21px Inter;opacity:.92">Book online in 30 seconds.</div>
    <div style="top:170px"><span class="btn2">Book a groom</span></div></div></div></div>
 <div class="why" style="top:1150px"><b>Fix:</b> your first line says what you do and where. That's what people are actually looking for.</div>
 <div class="ft"><span>@nexaweb_dev</span><span class="dots" data-on="2"></span></div>
</div>

<!-- 3 wide range -->
<div class="s" id="s3">
 <div class="ph"><img src="img/shower.jpg" style="object-position:50% 40%"></div><div class="num">02</div>
 <div class="h">"A wide range of <em>services"</em></div>
 <div class="sub">Which ones? Nobody rings to find out.</div>
 <div class="card" style="top:600px;transform:rotate(1deg)">
  <div class="ba old"><span class="lb">BEFORE</span><span class="tx">We offer a wide range of services.</span></div>
  <div class="ba new" style="padding-bottom:6px"><span class="lb">AFTER</span><span class="tx" style="font-size:26px">Say exactly what you do</span></div>
  <div class="row" style="padding:22px 34px"><span>Full groom, wash and cut</span><span class="v">from $85</span></div>
  <div class="row" style="padding:22px 34px"><span>Bath and blow dry</span><span class="v">from $55</span></div>
  <div class="row" style="padding:22px 34px;border:0"><span><span class="mk">Nail trim, walk ins welcome</span></span><span class="v">$20</span></div></div>
 <div class="why" style="top:1140px"><b>Fix:</b> list your actual services by name. It's also the words people type into Google.</div>
 <div class="ft"><span>@nexaweb_dev</span><span class="dots" data-on="3"></span></div>
</div>

<!-- 4 passionate -->
<div class="s" id="s4">
 <div class="ph"><img src="img/golden.jpg" style="object-position:50% 45%"></div><div class="num">03</div>
 <div class="h">"Passionate about <em>excellence"</em></div>
 <div class="sub">Every business says it. So it says nothing.</div>
 <div class="card" style="top:600px;transform:rotate(-1deg)">
  <div class="ba old"><span class="lb">BEFORE</span><span class="tx">We're passionate about excellence.</span></div>
  <div class="ba new"><span class="lb">AFTER</span><span class="tx" style="font-size:26px">Show it with a detail</span></div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:26px;padding:4px 30px 30px">
   <div style="width:210px;height:190px;border-radius:16px;background:url(img/groom.jpg) 50% 35%/cover;flex:none"></div>
   <div style="font-size:25px;line-height:1.45;color:#3a3742">Nervous dog? <span class="mk">We start every first visit with 10 minutes of treats and sniffing</span> before the clippers come out.</div></div></div>
 <div class="why" style="top:1120px"><b>Fix:</b> swap the adjective for one specific thing you do. Specific sounds true.</div>
 <div class="ft"><span>@nexaweb_dev</span><span class="dots" data-on="4"></span></div>
</div>

<!-- 5 click here -->
<div class="s" id="s5">
 <div class="ph"><img src="img/typing.jpg" style="object-position:50% 50%"></div><div class="num">04</div>
 <div class="h">"Click <em>here"</em></div>
 <div class="sub">Here where? People scan for the link they want.</div>
 <div class="card" style="top:610px;transform:rotate(1deg)">
  <div class="ba old"><span class="lb">BEFORE</span><span class="tx" style="font:500 27px/1.4 Inter">For our prices, <u style="color:#4a6cf7">click here</u>.</span></div>
  <div class="ba new"><span class="lb">AFTER</span><span class="tx" style="font:500 27px/1.4 Inter;color:#1f1d24"><u style="color:#4a6cf7"><span class="mk">See our grooming prices</span></u></span></div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:6px 30px 30px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="btnx">Learn more</span><span style="font:800 26px Inter;color:#8a8794;align-self:center">&#8594;</span><span class="btn2">See before and after photos</span></div></div>
 <div class="why" style="top:1110px"><b>Fix:</b> make every link and button say where it goes. Google's own link guide asks for descriptive link text too.</div>
 <div class="ft"><span>@nexaweb_dev</span><span class="dots" data-on="5"></span></div>
</div>

<!-- 6 submit -->
<div class="s" id="s6">
 <div class="ph"><img src="img/running.jpg" style="object-position:50% 45%"></div><div class="num">05</div>
 <div class="h">"<em>Submit"</em></div>
 <div class="sub">Nobody wants to submit anything.</div>
 <div class="card" style="top:600px;transform:rotate(-1deg)">
  <div class="bar"><span class="d"></span><span class="url"><b>fernbrookgrooming</b>.com.au/book</span></div>
  <div class="lbl">Dog's name</div><div class="fld">Biscuit</div>
  <div class="lbl">Breed and size</div><div class="fld">Cavoodle, small</div>
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;padding:26px 30px 30px">
   <span class="btnx" style="text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:#d93a3a;text-decoration-thickness:3px">Submit</span>
   <span style="font:800 28px Inter;color:#8a8794">&#8594;</span>
   <span class="btn2" style="font-size:23px;padding:16px 26px"><span class="mk" data-c="1">Book Biscuit's groom</span></span></div></div>
 <div class="why" style="top:1110px"><b>Fix:</b> the button says what they get. "Get my free quote". "Book my groom". "Send my question".</div>
 <div class="ft"><span>@nexaweb_dev</span><span class="dots" data-on="6"></span></div>
</div>

<!-- 7 cta -->
<div class="s" id="s7">
 <div class="h" style="top:110px;font-size:84px">How many are on your site <em>right now?</em></div>
 <div id="list" style="position:absolute;left:80px;right:80px;top:330px;z-index:3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"></div>
 <div style="position:absolute;left:80px;right:80px;top:960px;font-size:36px;line-height:1.5;color:#D9D3F2;z-index:3">Comment your number &#128071;<br>Save this for your next website update.<br>Follow <b style="color:var(--lav)">@nexaweb_dev</b> for more like this.</div>
 <div class="ft"><span>@nexaweb_dev</span><span class="dots" data-on="7"></span></div>
</div>
